From bcb0c020213a970a7a533fcd700407845ba857b8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 22:34:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Menus and declared screens for WASM block entities (API block
 7)

Menu types get a screen (slots, bars, sprites, text, buttons) read from data
slots, with no client code; container-spec.menu opens the menu of the
block's id; menu-data in block-entity and update; menu-button server event;
screen maths in horizon_mods::screen (tested); menu-demo example and harness
support (press, block-menu-data).
